==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration features Burmy in its Plant Cloak, Sandy Cloak, and Trash Cloak {{form|Burmy|forms}}.
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Brilliant Diamond}}.

